Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4553822Z Description-en: easy-to-use, scalable distributed version control system
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4554358Z  Mercurial is a fast, lightweight Source Control Management system designed
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4554821Z  for efficient handling of very large distributed projects.
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4555175Z  .
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4555481Z  Its features include:
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4555807Z  * O(1) delta-compressed file storage and retrieval scheme
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4556327Z  * Complete cross-indexing of files and changesets for efficient exploration
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4556856Z  of project history
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4557293Z  * Robust SHA1-based integrity checking and append-only storage model
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4557757Z  * Decentralized development model with arbitrary merging between trees
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4558223Z  * High-speed HTTP-based network merge protocol
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4558662Z  * Easy-to-use command-line interface
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4559054Z  * Integrated stand-alone web interface
Deploy	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-09-09T10:00:57.4559376Z  * Small Python codebase
